
# portfolio

## loading
- the initial portfolio loader closes after 1600 milliseconds regardless of image preload completion @implemented
- portfolio images preload from the smallest responsive tier to larger tiers and unfinished work continues after the loader closes @implemented
- the fixed loader window prioritizes smallest thumbnails while larger preload tiers use limited background concurrency to avoid blocking hover frames @implemented

## interaction
- portfolio hover selection matches the project title under the pointer on every animation frame, including while scrolling @implemented
- project title hover feedback and preview image changes have no transition delay @implemented

## images
- portfolio list previews use the smallest responsive thumbnail while detail views request larger sources at high priority @implemented
